WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.387
Why these two together?

2
00:00:01.387 --> 00:00:04.262
Because they keep detection
and response joined up.

3
00:00:04.262 --> 00:00:09.250
Detection should see one story across
the endpoint, identity and cloud apps.

4
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.562
And response should stay inside the
boundary the authorizing official set.

5
00:00:13.562 --> 00:00:17.986
By the end of this chapter you can show
that identity and cloud-app sources are

6
00:00:17.986 --> 00:00:22.342
feeding incidents, that Defender's
automation matches the response ladder,

7
00:00:22.342 --> 00:00:27.250
and that every exclusion is approved, with
every emergency access account protected.

8
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.231
It's for the developers,
the security operations

9
00:00:30.231 --> 00:00:33.190
lead who owns both gates,
and the platform owner.
